    "scripts/check_shared.py, which checks it, and shared/README.md, which says how to change one.",
    "`owner` is where an edit is made first. `path` is the same in both repositories unless the",
    "entry names a path per repository. Never edit a sha256 by hand: `python3 scripts/check_shared.py --update`."
